20, 2026, following Steam Next Fest!First of all, we'd like to extend a huge thank you to everyone who has played our demo, shared their feedback, left comments, and supported us throughout development. Your thoughts and suggestions have been incr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T19:31:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934486","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1843481262691819","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cabin – Summer Vacation by CellStudios","summary":"Hey, Everyone!Today, We’d like to introduce you to The Cabin – Summer Vacation, a story-driven adult visual novel from CellStudios that combines kinky romance with mystery, danger, and horror. CHECK OUT THE CABIN ON STEAMNot Quite the Summer Vacation You PlannedAn unfortunate series of events sends you to a secluded cabin in the middle of the woods.At first, the trip is every bit as uneventful as you feared. Before long, however, things begin disappearing, strange noises disturb the night, and i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T10:49:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1841579228669480","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"update","title":"Update 1/2 Is Now Live!","summary":"Hello, everyone! Update 1/2 for the Leap Into Life: Episode 1 Demo is now live! With this release, we’ve added a substantial amount of new content, along with several fixes and quality-of-life improvements based on player feedback. We’d love to hear what you think of it, so feel free to share your feedback on Steam Discussions or join us on Discord. Update Notes — Demo Update 1/2 New Content 327 new renders 20 new animations Fixes Improvements and fixes to the save system Fixed stuttering during","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T17:03:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1840944183779632","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1/2 Date!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We’ll be releasing the Leap Into Life Episode 1 Demo Update 1/2, which we previously announced, on August 21. Don’t forget to follow us so you don’t miss it!We’re eagerly awaiting your feedback! You can reach us on Steam Discussions and Discord.Don’t forget to add Leap Into Life Episode 1 to your Wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T13:30:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1840310314345411","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"update","title":"Update 1/2 Coming Soon!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We’re about to finish the first of the two updates we’ve planned for Leap Into Life Episode 1 Demo. We’re excited to announce that we’ll be releasing Update 1/2 very soon!The content of Demo Update 1/2 will be roughly as follows:~300 renders~15 animationsDon’t forget to try out the Leap Into Life Episode 1 Demo and add our game to your Wishlist! We also look forward to your feedback and suggestions on Steam Discussions and our Discord server.Here’s a little sneak peek from the de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T15:42:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1839676055888233","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"update","title":"Devlog - Demo Update 1/2","summary":"Hello, everyone!Today we'd like to announce the first part of the update we've planned for the Leap Into Life Episode 1 Demo.We've split the demo update into two parts, and we're working on releasing Update 1/2 in the coming days. A significant portion of this part of the update is already complete; scenes are being set up, renders are being processed, and animations are being keyed!The content we've planned for Update 1/2 is roughly as follows:~300 renders~15 animationsWe care about your feedba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T13:59:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888233","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1839041357038962","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update in the Works!","summary":"Hello Everyone!A huge thank you to all of you for the amazing interest and feedback on the Leap Into Life Episode 1 demo! Seeing your excitement for the game has been incredibly motivating for our team.We've been reading every single one of your comments. We heard your feedback regarding the demo's length, and we're excited to share that we've started working on a new Demo Update to extend your playtime!Don't forget to follow us and add the game to your Wishlist so you don't miss out on the upco","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T17:55:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038962","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1839041357029824","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Was Released Today!","summary":"Hello, everyone!Leap Into Life Episode 1 DEMO was released today. Thank you all for your interest. Don't forget to try out the demo version of Leap Into Life Episode 1 and give us your feedback!A summary of the content included in the demo:The first 5 sequences from Episode 1~25 minutes of playable content331 renders22 animationsWe're eagerly awaiting your feedback; you can also reach us on our Discord server. Don't forget to add the game to your Wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T15:01:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357029824","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1839041357026646","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Announcement!","summary":"Hello everyone! Leap Into Life Episode 1 DEMO launches on STEAM tomorrow! Don't forget to visit the page and add it to your Wishlist! Play the demo and give us feedback so we can create better content for everyone!High-quality rendersMeticulously crafted opening sequence animations3D missions you can navigate from a top-down perspectiveDon't forget to join our Discord and add the game to your wishlist! Your feedback is very important to us!AI Image and AI Animation were not used in the game in a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T13:20:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357026646","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731990-1838407329268343","game_id":"steam-4731990","kind":"announcement","t